    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years Gone By is the natural following episode of the other Fineam Neo Studio Production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time with better game-play, graphics, sounds and game mechanics, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has been developed in Java (thanks to @KaarinGaming).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 5 levels that will test your ability and sharpness in order to defeat all the enemies in each level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a level means beating all the nasty creatures that invaded your beloved paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be wary of the difficult environment and terrain and remember, you are a knight and your armor prevents you to swim!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls for the game are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys &lt;- -&gt; to move left and right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space bar to jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left click mouse to light attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click mouse to use a special attack ( needs action bar points )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a bit more to say, but why not find out yourself? ;-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is not very resource hungry so should run pretty much everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years Gone By is the natural following episode of the other Fineam Neo Studio Production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time with better game-play, graphics, sounds and game mechanics, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has been developed in Java (thanks to @KaarinGaming).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 5 levels that will test your ability and sharpness in order to defeat all the enemies in each level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a level means beating all the nasty creatures that invaded your beloved paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be wary of the difficult environment and terrain and remember, you are a knight and your armor prevents you to swim!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls for the game are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys &lt;- -&gt; to move left and right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space bar to jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left click mouse to light attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click mouse to use a special attack ( needs action bar points )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a bit more to say, but why not find out yourself? ;-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is not very resource hungry so should run pretty much everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
